WEBVTT

00:00:03.307 --> 00:00:05.473
<v><b>A:</b></v> Have you <b>seen <i>Little Women</i></b>?

00:00:06.004 --> 00:00:07.768
<v><b>B:</b></v> <b>No</b>, I <b>haven’t</b>.

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:09.488
<v><b>A:</b></v> Have you <b>read</b> the <b>book</b>?

00:00:09.814 --> 00:00:13.394
<v><b>B:</b></v> <b>Yes</b>, I <b>have</b>. I’ve <b>read</b> it <b>twice</b>.